{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nightmarena is a 2D Turn based fighting game with rogue lite elements (randomized enemies) and timed dodging of enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in a series of turn based battles in the arena. Dodge enemy attacks in various ways and respond with your own powerful martial arts skills to defeat enemy after enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666030/extras/firedodge.jpg?t=1745246967\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attempt the arena, fighting progressively stronger foes, starting with bandits and going all the way up to dragons and uncover the hidden lore every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your character after every arena attempt, getting closer and closer to your goal of finding a special ingredient that can cure a very rare disease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666030/extras/Base.jpg?t=1745246967\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feature breakdown:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FIght enemies in turn based combat one after another, using timed inputs for dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain &quot;Energi&quot; for every enemy you defeated in an arena attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use &quot;Energi&quot; to unlock new abilities and raise your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit various factions of combatants to learn their stories and spar with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck, Venturer.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666030?t=1745246967","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666030?t=1745246967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666030/e0a31d6c9287e7598bdba02c069c601acbea96fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745246967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666030/e0a31d6c9287e7598bdba02c069c601acbea96fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745246967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nightmarena is a 2D Turn based fighting game with rogue lite elements (randomized enemies) and timed dodging of enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in a series of turn based battles in the arena. Dodge enemy attacks in various ways and respond with your own powerful martial arts skills to defeat enemy after enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666030/extras/firedodge.jpg?t=1745246967\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attempt the arena, fighting progressively stronger foes, starting with bandits and going all the way up to dragons and uncover the hidden lore every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your character after every arena attempt, getting closer and closer to your goal of finding a special ingredient that can cure a very rare disease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666030/extras/Base.jpg?t=1745246967\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feature breakdown:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FIght enemies in turn based combat one after another, using timed inputs for dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain &quot;Energi&quot; for every enemy you defeated in an arena attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use &quot;Energi&quot; to unlock new abilities and raise your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit various factions of combatants to learn their stories and spar with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck, Venturer.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Colo Coko"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666030/fbd89b851304119c36ae2d8438b358c829f0980e/header.jpg?t=1745246967","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125743,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125743/movie480.mp4?t=1745246966","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125743/movie_max.mp4?t=1745246966"},"name":"Game Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125743/9eb0e62f0645b5e5088dbc2e666f6c8bbeeb99cc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745246966","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125743/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745246966","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125743/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745246966"}}],"name":"Nightmarena","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  810x540<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 15 Ou